---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us — FreeFontFinderAI | Transparent Typography Detection"
  description="Discover the mission behind FreeFontFinderAI: delivering fast, private, 100% free typography recognition powered by open-source Google Fonts and modern browser engineering."
  canonicalUrl="https://freefontfinderai.com/about"
>
  <article class="py-12 sm:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-[1000px] mx-auto transition-colors">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-white/[0.03] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] font-mono text-[11px] text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98] mb-4 shadow-sm">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#ff4d00] dark:bg-[#e4f222]"></span>
        <span>ENGINEERING TRANSPARENCY & OPEN TYPOGRAPHY</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.022em]">
        About FreeFontFinderAI
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Building a cleaner, faster, and truly open way to discover, analyze, and implement typography on the web.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98]">
      
      <!-- Mission Section -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] dark:border-[#e4f222] pl-3.5 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.012em]">
            Why We Built FreeFontFinderAI
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          For years, identifying a font from an image meant dealing with frustrating roadblocks: mandatory account registrations, intrusive video popups, subscription paywalls, and recommendations for expensive commercial fonts costing hundreds of dollars per style.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          We believed designers and developers deserved something fundamentally better: an instant, in-browser optical matcher that identifies typography in milliseconds, matches authentic open-source alternatives, and gives you copy-ready CSS code without tracking you or asking for a credit card.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 4 Pillars Grid -->
      <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#ff4d00] dark:bg-[#e4f222]"></span>
            <h3 class="font-[510] text-[15px] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff]">100% Free & Unlimited</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98] leading-relaxed">
            No daily scan limits, no premium tiers, no email gates, and zero hidden charges. You can analyze as many screenshots and graphics as you need.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#16a34a] dark:bg-[#27a644]"></span>
            <h3 class="font-[510] text-[15px] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff]">Zero Image Retention</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98] leading-relaxed">
            Your images are processed locally within your browser tab using HTML5 Canvas. Your files are never stored or logged on any external server.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#ff4d00] dark:bg-[#e4f222]"></span>
            <h3 class="font-[510] text-[15px] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff]">Verified Open-Source Fonts</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98] leading-relaxed">
            Every match is cross-referenced against authentic Google Fonts licensed under the SIL Open Font License, free for personal and commercial projects.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#ff4d00] dark:bg-[#e4f222]"></span>
            <h3 class="font-[510] text-[15px] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff]">Production-Ready Blueprints</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98] leading-relaxed">
            Copy tested CSS <code class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#ff4d00] dark:text-[#e4f222] bg-[#f1f3f6] dark:bg-[#161718] px-1 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a]">@import</code> and <code class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#ff4d00] dark:text-[#e4f222] bg-[#f1f3f6] dark:bg-[#161718] px-1 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a]">font-family</code> rules directly into your codebase, with real-time weight sliders.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Technology Section -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] dark:border-[#e4f222] pl-3.5 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.012em]">
            How the Technology Works
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          FreeFontFinderAI combines optical character recognition (OCR) with client-side geometric feature extraction. When an image is loaded:
        </p>
        <ol class="space-y-2.5 list-decimal pl-5 mt-3.5 text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          <li><strong>Text Line & Glyph Segmentation:</strong> The engine isolates text regions and separates individual characters.</li>
          <li><strong>Geometric Feature Vector Extraction:</strong> It analyzes stroke weight, x-height to cap-height ratio, aspect ratios, aperture curves, and serif geometry.</li>
          <li><strong>Pre-Calculated Mathematical Cosine Comparison:</strong> Character traits are compared against over 1,900 verified font signatures in client memory, returning ranked matches in under 150ms.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <!-- Explore Tools & Contact CTA -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#f8f9fa] to-white dark:from-[#141518] dark:to-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.015em]">
          Have questions or ideas for new typography tools?
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] sm:text-[14px] text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98] max-w-lg mx-auto">
          We are constantly refining our optical engine and adding new designer utilities. We'd love to hear your feedback.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <a
            href="/"
            class="btn-acid-lime inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-[8px] text-[13px] font-[550] shadow-sm transition-all cursor-pointer"
          >
            <span>Try Font Finder</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-[8px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#141518] hover:bg-[#f8f9fa] dark:hover:bg-[#1a1b1f] text-[#334155] dark:text-[#c9ced6] text-[13px] font-[450] transition-all shadow-sm"
          >
            <span>Contact Us</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
